WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.629 line:8%
Open Help & support and choose Feedback inbox.

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:06.803 line:8%
Filter by status and open the request.

00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:10.150 line:8%
Read the steps and expected result.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:15.222 line:8%
Choose a clear status and write a helpful response with the next action.

00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:17.544 line:8%
Save the response.

00:00:17.544 --> 00:00:24.959 line:8%
The author can see the status and reply in My feedback; earlier replies remain in the conversation.
